# Build context hygiene for the Dokploy images (deploy/dokploy/*).
# Without this, COPY apps ./apps drags in local node_modules and build output,
# which both bloats the context and lets host-built artifacts shadow the ones
# the image builds itself.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.medusa
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.cache

.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
.agents

# Local env — never bake secrets into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Local-only tooling and docs
docker-compose.postgres.yml
docker-compose.redis.yml
LOCAL-SETUP.md
CLAUDE.local.md

**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
